WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
One Hub brings data, analysis, and reporting together.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Select the country, year, and correct source file in Data Control.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Hub actions update the personal source; SharePoint is the future team mode.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
The Hub checks required files and worksheets before processing.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The target flow processes, reconciles, and preserves each run's audit trail.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Results return to the Hub with status and source lineage.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Every KPI and chart updates to the same filter scope.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Variance compares Actual with Budget or Forecast and highlights gaps.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Budget and Forecast track three scenarios; missing periods are not treated as zero.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
P&L supports branch selection, subtotal checks, and scoped export.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Sign-in, roles, and audit controls govern every action.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
One Hub speeds up data input, controls, analysis, and review.
